; Zone Online faction relations
; Derived from vanilla Anomaly configs\creatures\game_relations.ltx
; [communities_relations], restricted to the selectable factions.
; Values: -2000 = enemy, 0 = neutral, 300 = ally, 2000 = coalition ally.
; The matrix is symmetric; server defaults are embedded in the Go build and
; seeded into the faction_relations database table when it is empty.

